{"id":"01ebb1c67b142b36","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-thm-whitehead.md","title":"Whitehead's Theorem","display":"thm-whitehead — Whitehead's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-whitehead","aliases":["58-thm-whitehead"],"display":"thm-whitehead — Whitehead's Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-path-connected.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-whitehead"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-whitehead</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-whitehead — Whitehead's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9c7e703f871c9421\" href=\"?note=9c7e703f871c9421\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md\">../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cc1ce993dd3ce56d\" href=\"?note=cc1ce993dd3ce56d\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md\">../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c682c089b3ac3182\" href=\"?note=c682c089b3ac3182\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group.md\">../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c100dce18000d9e7\" href=\"?note=c100dce18000d9e7\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-path-connected.md\">../batch03/58-df-path-connected.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi_X)\">\\((X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi_X)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Y,\\tau_Y,\\vec Y,\\vec\\Phi_Y)\">\\((Y,\\tau_Y,\\vec Y,\\vec\\Phi_Y)\\)</span> (CW complexes)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\to Y\">\\(f:X\\to Y\\)</span> (continuous map) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_\\ast\">\\(f_\\ast\\)</span> (induced maps on components and homotopy groups)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S,\\mathrm{Continuous}_S,\\mathrm{Homotopic}_S,\\mathrm{Contractible}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S,\\mathrm{Continuous}_S,\\mathrm{Homotopic}_S,\\mathrm{Contractible}_S\\)</span> (upstream predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective},\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective},\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S\\)</span> (upstream predicates)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}whitehead}\\vdash\\;&amp;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S(Y,\\tau_Y,\\vec Y,\\vec\\Phi_Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\pi_0(f),\\pi_0(X),\\pi_0(Y))\n\\land\\forall x_0\\in X\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\mathrm{Bijective}\\bigl(\\pi_n(f,x_0),\\pi_n(X,x_0),\\pi_n(Y,f(x_0))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists g:Y\\to X\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(g,Y,\\tau_Y,X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Homotopic}_S(g\\circ f,\\operatorname{id}_X,X,\\tau_X,X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Homotopic}_S(f\\circ g,\\operatorname{id}_Y,Y,\\tau_Y,Y,\\tau_Y)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}whitehead}\\vdash\\;&amp;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S(Y,\\tau_Y,\\vec Y,\\vec\\Phi_Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\pi_0(f),\\pi_0(X),\\pi_0(Y))\n\\land\\forall x_0\\in X\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\mathrm{Bijective}\\bigl(\\pi_n(f,x_0),\\pi_n(X,x_0),\\pi_n(Y,f(x_0))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists g:Y\\to X\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(g,Y,\\tau_Y,X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Homotopic}_S(g\\circ f,\\operatorname{id}_X,X,\\tau_X,X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Homotopic}_S(f\\circ g,\\operatorname{id}_Y,Y,\\tau_Y,Y,\\tau_Y)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}whitehead}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi_X)\n\\land X\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S(X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\bigl(\\exists x_0\\in X\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;(\\pi_n(X,x_0)=\\{e_n\\})\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\to\\mathrm{Contractible}_S(X,\\tau_X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}whitehead}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi_X)\n\\land X\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S(X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\bigl(\\exists x_0\\in X\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;(\\pi_n(X,x_0)=\\{e_n\\})\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\to\\mathrm{Contractible}_S(X,\\tau_X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A weak homotopy equivalence need not be a homotopy equivalence in general.</li>\n<li>Whitehead's theorem requires a weak homotopy equivalence: bijection on path components and isomorphisms on all pointed homotopy groups.</li>\n<li>Because every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_n(f,x_0)\">\\(\\pi_n(f,x_0)\\)</span> is already an induced group homomorphism, requiring it to be bijective expresses group isomorphism without introducing the formerly undeclared <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroupIsomorphism}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GroupIsomorphism}_S\\)</span> predicate.</li>\n<li>Continuity, homotopy, contractibility, and path connectedness now use the arities fixed by their upstream atoms.</li>\n<li>The CW approximation theorem builds CW complexes approximating spaces.</li>\n<li>The second assertion is the weakly contractible CW-complex corollary; path connectedness replaces the ill-typed expression <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_0(X)=0\">\\(\\pi_0(X)=0\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md","status":"resolved","id":"9c7e703f871c9421","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md","status":"resolved","id":"cc1ce993dd3ce56d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"c682c089b3ac3182","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-homotopy-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-path-connected.md","status":"resolved","id":"c100dce18000d9e7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-path-connected.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi_X)","display":false},{"tex":"(Y,\\tau_Y,\\vec Y,\\vec\\Phi_Y)","display":false},{"tex":"f:X\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"f_\\ast","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S,\\mathrm{Continuous}_S,\\mathrm{Homotopic}_S,\\mathrm{Contractible}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective},\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}whitehead}\\vdash\\;&\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S(Y,\\tau_Y,\\vec Y,\\vec\\Phi_Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\pi_0(f),\\pi_0(X),\\pi_0(Y))\n\\land\\forall x_0\\in X\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\n\\mathrm{Bijective}\\bigl(\\pi_n(f,x_0),\\pi_n(X,x_0),\\pi_n(Y,f(x_0))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\to\\exists g:Y\\to X\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(g,Y,\\tau_Y,X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Homotopic}_S(g\\circ f,\\operatorname{id}_X,X,\\tau_X,X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Homotopic}_S(f\\circ g,\\operatorname{id}_Y,Y,\\tau_Y,Y,\\tau_Y)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}whitehead}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi_X)\n\\land X\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S(X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\bigl(\\exists x_0\\in X\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;(\\pi_n(X,x_0)=\\{e_n\\})\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\to\\mathrm{Contractible}_S(X,\\tau_X).","display":true},{"tex":"\\pi_n(f,x_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GroupIsomorphism}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_0(X)=0","display":false}],"bytes":2598,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4489","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-thm-whitehead.md|58-thm-whitehead]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["9c7e703f871c9421","cc1ce993dd3ce56d","c682c089b3ac3182","3cd1834de4f2efb2","d583890235faf0d5","c100dce18000d9e7"]}